+## 새로운 Opcode 등록
+
+![OPCODE_REGISTRAR](../Images/opcode_registrar.png)
+
+## UFunction 주입
+
+![OPCODE_INJECTION](../Images/opcode_injection.png)
+
+![CUSTOMIZED_THUNK_FUNC](../Images/customized_thunk_func.png)
